  "$hostingComment": [
    "Free / instant hosting and site-builder platforms. Each is ALSO a public suffix (parse.js",
    "merges this list in), so 'evil.vercel.app' has registrable domain 'evil.vercel.app' and",
    "one tenant can never inherit another's reputation. The `free-hosting` check reads it too:",
    "anyone can publish on these in under a minute, with no identity and a valid certificate,",
    "which is why most live phishing in public feeds sits on them. Dynamic-DNS names (duckdns.org,",
    "zapto.org) and IPFS gateways are here for the same reason: a name with no owner behind it."
  ],
